 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 508763,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The graph shown is the graph of which quadratic equation?\n<img src=\"exercises/media/58e4dfc87e9f8178.jpg\" alt=\"A parabola is plotted on an x y coordinate plane. The x and y axes range from negative 10 to 10, in increments of 1. The parabola opens up and it passes through the following points, (negative 5, 0), (negative 3, negative 4), and (negative 1, 0).\">\n",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 996552,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"{x^2}-x + 5 = 0\">{x^2}-x + 5 = 0</span>",
     "correctness": "0.0"
    },
    {
     "id": 996553,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"{x^2}-5x + 1 = 0\">{x^2}-5x + 1 = 0</span>",
     "correctness": "0.0"
    },
    {
     "id": 996554,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"{x^2} + 6x + 5 = 0\">{x^2} + 6x + 5 = 0</span>",
     "correctness": "1.0"
    },
    {
     "id": 996555,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"{x^2}-4x + 5 = 0\">{x^2}-4x + 5 = 0</span>",
     "correctness": "0.0"
    }
   ],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response",
    "multiple-choice"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Since it intersects the <span data-math=\"x\"></span>-axis at –5 and –1, you can “reverse” solve.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = - 5\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = - 1\"></span></td>\n<td>Write the factors they came from.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x + 5 = 0\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"x + 1 = 0\"></span></td>\n<td>Multiply together to get the quadratic equation.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left({x + 5} \\right)\\left({x + 1} \\right) = 0\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Distribute twice to expand the polynomial.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"{x^2} + 5x + x + 5 = 0\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"{x^2} + 6x + 5 = 0\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>This is the correct option.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
